{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:35c454089e161362","name":"Electric Defense Grid","source":{"id":"source:reference-35c454089e161362","title":"Electric Defense Grid","revision":21034,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:02:11Z","sha256":"06b35a1c0170708673d33d3b1eb57fde8c27581ca5ae0941df759cf46e8da9b2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21034","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Electric%20Defense%20Grid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-35c454089e161362","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,000 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (100 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most Combat Droids are effective at using blasters and other ranged weapons. Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Models"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Models"},", however, fail miserably at melee combat and are quickly dispatched by enemies that gain the upper hand in close quarters. To improve a Droid's melee defenses, an Electric Defense Grid can be installed either on top of or as part of the Droid's armor or outer shell.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with an Electric Defense Grid is damaged by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", the attacker automatically takes 5 points of Energy damage. Melee weapons that rely on Energy to cause damage, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", are immune to the effect of the Electric Defense Grid.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
